# openpi (π0.5 VLA baseline) — vendored as a PLAIN CHECKOUT, pinned upstream commit 215abfb
# (recorded in docs/DEVLOG.md 2026-08-30). Ignored rather than tracked because the working tree
# carries its own .venv, its 12 GB pi05_base asset cache and its fine-tune checkpoints (~49 GB).
# TODO: register it as a proper submodule (repo convention for third_party) so the pin is in git.
third_party/openpi/
# LeRobot datasets derived from dataset/demos by gentle_manip/pi05/convert_to_lerobot.py
dataset/lerobot/

# Eval / observation VIDEO outputs under docs/figures (2026-09-01). PNG figures ARE tracked
# (18 of them); mp4s are not — they are large (~22 MB per batch) and regenerable from the eval
# dirs on the cluster (<run>/eval/<subdir>/render/) or via gentle_manip/pi05/visualize_rgb.py.
docs/figures/**/*.mp4

dataset/transfer/

